From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:49:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] BlueOS: DeskClock: Widgets 0.6

- Clock card: the halo over the minutes too; narrow and wide layouts.
- Halo clock: dark or light text layouts with theme colors resolved by the
  launcher (the baked colors lagged behind the theme).
- Tile: resizable, one row by default.
- New "Next alarm" widget.
- Card transparency from Wallpaper & style; refreshed on SystemUI's
  WIDGET_STYLE_CHANGED.

Change-Id: I8255b3cf7ee46ece91a9a464ae0c3846532692d0
